      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 3.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.04,
      "end_seconds": 10.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.85,
      "end_seconds": 16.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.7,
      "end_seconds": 30.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "It's being thirsty. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.44,
      "end_seconds": 35.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.9,
      "end_seconds": 40.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "It's been like this since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.96,
      "end_seconds": 44.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.32,
      "end_seconds": 47.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.34,
      "end_seconds": 52.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.12,
      "end_seconds": 55.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.49,
      "end_seconds": 74.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Okay, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.42,
      "end_seconds": 83.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Oh, not currently, but as a youngster diclofenac gave me swelling of my lips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.84,
      "end_seconds": 104.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.0,
      "end_seconds": 107.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.84,
      "end_seconds": 111.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.92,
      "end_seconds": 116.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.74,
      "end_seconds": 127.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Right, now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.78,
      "end_seconds": 138.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I swim twice a week. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.0,
      "end_seconds": 142.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Did you notice any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.11,
      "end_seconds": 148.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Right, no, I haven't had any vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 152.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Did you get weight loss or abdominal pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.84,
      "end_seconds": 160.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "No weight loss or abdominal pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.32,
      "end_seconds": 166.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.03,
      "end_seconds": 169.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.06,
      "end_seconds": 174.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.34,
      "end_seconds": 188.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.43,
      "end_seconds": 211.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 156 over 100, temp 36.7 degrees, pulse 90."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.63,
      "end_seconds": 216.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.08,
      "end_seconds": 219.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.47,
      "end_seconds": 244.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Your weight is up a little and there are no sores on your feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.52,
      "end_seconds": 260.19,
      "duration_seconds": 12.67,
      "text": "Please sit back down. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with possible type 2 diabetes pending blood tests at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.07,
      "end_seconds": 266.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Right, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.26,
      "end_seconds": 280.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.32,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible type 2 diabetes pending blood tests, and we'll know more once the an HbA1c test is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.27,
      "end_seconds": 320.31,
      "duration_seconds": 31.04,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an HbA1c test because of thirst. Cut sugary drinks and walk after meals while we wait for results. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Let's hold off on a fasting glucose for now, and if there's no change in a month we can revisit it. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.62,
      "end_seconds": 325.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I'll want another look after the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.66,
      "end_seconds": 329.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.61,
      "end_seconds": 333.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.73,
      "end_seconds": 337.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.32,
      "end_seconds": 340.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Right, all the best."
    }
  ]
